 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS CodeDeploy API (2014-10-06). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Applications and custom deployment configurations are configuration metadata: no deployment, revision, instance, hook or GitHub link exists. CreateDeployment, deployment groups and on-premises instance APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501; applications cannot be renamed. Predefined CodeDeployDefault configurations are not modeled: they are neither listed nor readable, and the prefix is refused. Server configurations require minimumHealthyHosts and refuse traffic routing.",
